  "details": "Add a link to the changelog of the selected/current version of the package installed on the Package manager GUI.\nFor example,\nI see that UdonSharp was upgraded from 1.0.1 -> 1.1.0, and I'd like to know what was changed, it would be a convenience to have the link published in the GUI instead of  hunting for the changelog.\n\nThe publisher of the package could include the link to the changelog via package.json, and maybe a readme link that they could direct the user their wiki page?",
